    <string name="wb_clock">An analog dial with the time, and the date when there is room. It changes once a minute, never every second.</string>
    <string name="wb_calendar">This month at a glance, with today marked. Days with events get a dot if you allow calendar access.</string>
    <string name="wb_agenda">Your next events over the coming seven days, from the calendars on the tablet. It needs calendar access.</string>
    <string name="wb_weather">The weather now and for the next days in a city you choose, from Open-Meteo. It never reads your location.</string>
    <string name="wb_battery">The battery level on a scale, and whether the tablet is charging.</string>
    <string name="wb_alarm">When your next alarm rings.</string>
