    <string name="tw_serif_title">Serif system font</string>
    <string name="tw_serif_summary">Changes the font Android uses for its own screens to Noto Serif, through a font option included in the firmware. Needs Shizuku, and is unavailable if the firmware lacks that option.</string>
    <string name="tw_note_serif">Affects Android settings and apps that use the system font. Boox apps keep their own fonts.</string>
